{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415667","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415667","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041566701:1":{"text":"ホットミルクだよ、イザベラ。","source_cn":"来，伊莎贝拉，先喝杯热牛奶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C74A9C95B87B5D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566702:1":{"text":"今回の任務で、お前が好きそうな本を見つけたんだ。","source_cn":"我这次任务顺便为你带了一本小册子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8D129A4C93C1C2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566703:1":{"text":"船乗りが書いた冒険物語らしい。","source_cn":"据说是水手写的冒险故事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x376FE3532A357A6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566704:1":{"text":"船乗り？死海の艦隊（モルティア）みたいな海賊の話？","source_cn":"水手？像死潮舰队那样的海盗故事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11A20D752D62B4F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566705:1":{"text":"たぶん……とにかく、船が出てくる話だよ。","source_cn":"类似吧……大概，总之是有人开船的故事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x341745CD71868068","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566706:1":{"text":"さすがに大雑把すぎるよ、お姉ちゃん。","source_cn":"姐姐对书本的评论太简洁啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x738920671D1F7057","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566707:1":{"text":"そう言えば、今回の任務も船を使ったの？海賊や人魚はいた？","source_cn":"说起来，姐姐这次任务也是坐船往返吗？有见到海盗和美人鱼吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x833A695E99E5F1B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566708:1":{"text":"ああ、船で移動した。海賊はいたが、人魚は……あれは人魚と呼べるのだろうか。","source_cn":"坐船，见到了海盗，但人鱼……我不确定那算不算是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5831CDA48A97220","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566709:1":{"text":"ほとんどは人間が相手だったよ。","source_cn":"主要还是与人类打交道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82016A3ECBA7F010","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566710:1":{"text":"おやつを持ってくるから、お前はここで本を読んでいなさい。","source_cn":"我去给你拿些点心，你在这里慢慢看书吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AF8A5357B482923","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566711:1":{"text":"任務の話になると、すぐ話を逸らすんだから……","source_cn":"每次一问姐姐任务，她就岔开话题……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD6DF189B0583BEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041566712:1":{"text":"いつになったら、お姉ちゃんの役に立てるのかな……","source_cn":"不知道什么时候才能帮得上姐姐的忙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE08C730AD33C63C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:西尔维娜":{"text":"シルヴィナ","source":"西尔维娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊莎贝拉":{"text":"イザベラ","source":"伊莎贝拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}